      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "(S)-4-amino-6-((1-(5-chloro-4-oxo-3-phenyl-3,4-dihydroquinazolin-2-yl)ethyl)amino)pyrimidine-5-carbonitrile is claimed as a highly selective, PI3Kδ inhibitor. It is claimed to be useful in the treatment of asthma and appears intended for oral administration. It is shown to be well absorbed after oral administration and to have reasonable metabolic stability."},
